# Intro to AI: Data is Essential for Building AI

This module focused on understanding the importance of data in Artificial Intelligence and how AI systems rely on data to learn, identify patterns, and make predictions.

Throughout this section, I explored different types of data, how machines process information, the role of labeled and unlabeled datasets, and why high-quality data is essential for building reliable AI systems.

